---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import aboutImg from "../assets/about.jpg";
---
<section class="bg-[var(--cream)] py-16 md:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-[1000px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="reveal grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center">
      <Image
        src={aboutImg}
        alt="Circle window looking into Studio 49 — the converted Victorian warehouse on Pixley Street"
        widths={[480, 768, 1024]}
        sizes="(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 100vw"
        format="webp"
        quality={75}
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover rounded-xl"
      />
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Who we are</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-medium text-[var(--brand-blue)] mb-4">A space for the work you love</h2>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--dark-charcoal)] mb-4">
          Hone Movement Studios is two light-filled studios in a warehouse in Limehouse — built for the people who live to move. Dancers, teachers, choreographers, theatre-makers, yogis, somatic practitioners, photographers. If you&rsquo;re here to create something, this is your room.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-[var(--dark-charcoal)]">
          Part of the HONE family of brands, but Movement is its own thing — its own people, its own energy. You book, you turn up, you get to work. We love what happens when the door closes and the music starts.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
